       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 211-25
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7682710"
    >
Separability.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7682710" data-guid="7682710"></div>
        <div id="questions-7682710" data-guid="7682710" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7682710_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">If any clause, sentence, paragraph, section or part of these regulations shall be adjudged by any court of competent jurisdiction to be invalid, such judgment shall be confined in its operation to the clause, sentence, paragraph, section or part thereof directly involved in the controversy in which such judgment shall have been rendered.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7682711"
      id="7682711"
      data-guid="7682711"
      data-position="5044"
      data-full-title="§ 211-26: Prior inconsistent ordinance."
      data-code-content-type="section"
  >
    <span class="selectionBox material-icons material-symbols-outlined material-symbols-and-filled md-24"
         title="Select this content"
         aria-label="Select this content"
    >
      <input type="checkbox" class="selectionBoxInput" id="7682711_input"/>
